# Difference Between OIC and GoldenGate

| OIC                            | GoldenGate                                           |
| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| Integrates applications        | Replicates database changes                          |
| Uses REST/SOAP/File            | Reads database transaction logs                      |
| Business process automation    | Real-time data replication                           |
| Works at application level     | Works at database level                              |
| Example: Create Invoice in ERP | Example: Replicate Invoice table to another database |

